JOLANTA MALINOWKSI: I-- I believe-- and that will be my wish-- to have a much bigger family, because I-- I like children, and I-- I-- I would dream to have a bigger family. But because everything what happened in our life, and what-- what life went on, and how their life went on, unfortunately I have only one child.

